1
00:00:09,471 --> 00:00:12,053
BLOOD AND BLACK LACE

2
00:01:59,920 --> 00:02:03,335
Directed by MARIO BAVA

3
00:02:40,625 --> 00:02:42,749
What 's got into you ? Why did you come here ?

4
00:02:42,812 --> 00:02:45,103
Don 't you realise that Isabella could see us ?

5
00:02:45,292 --> 00:02:47,623
- Have you got any ? - No .

6
00:02:48,167 --> 00:02:49,790
I can 't take this any more .

7
00:02:51,291 --> 00:02:53,874
If I don 't get some soon I 'll go crazy .

8
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:57,540
Don 't be like that , Franco . Have you tried asking Isabella ?

9
00:02:59,332 --> 00:03:00,956
We had an argument .

10
00:03:02,707 --> 00:03:05,455
She even stole what I had , damn her .

11
00:03:05,582 --> 00:03:06,997
Try to hang on in there .

12
00:03:07,123 --> 00:03:09,164
When I 've finished work we 'll find some .

13
00:03:09,189 --> 00:03:11,812
Trust me . I 'll help you .

14
00:03:13,039 --> 00:03:14,080
Now go .

15
00:03:14,105 --> 00:03:17,187
I 'm counting on you . Thanks . I 'll be waiting .

16
00:03:54,703 --> 00:03:55,909
Bye .

17
00:03:57,077 --> 00:03:59,368
Isabella . Your scarf .

18
00:03:59,952 --> 00:04:00,993
Thank you .

19
00:04:01,119 --> 00:04:02,326
- Bye . - Bye .

20
00:06:54,147 --> 00:06:55,770
What 's wrong ?

21
00:06:55,896 --> 00:06:58,603
The sign 's fallen off again .

22
00:06:59,688 --> 00:07:03,769
- Do you want me to go and fix it ? - No , not tonight .

23
00:07:03,895 --> 00:07:05,727
You can do it in the morning .

24
00:07:47,100 --> 00:07:49,807
Same old story ... Isabella 's late again .

25
00:07:50,350 --> 00:07:53,682
I don 't know what 's wrong with that girl . This is the third time .

26
00:07:53,808 --> 00:07:57,140
There 's no need to get angry , just give her a hefty fine .

27
00:07:57,266 --> 00:08:01,722
I certainly will , and I 'll fire her if she 's as late as she was yesterday .

28
00:08:15,265 --> 00:08:17,930
- Good night , Madame . - Good night .

29
00:08:20,430 --> 00:08:21,638
Nicole .

30
00:08:22,139 --> 00:08:24,929
Look at this dress . Try to take more care of the clothes .

31
00:08:25,055 --> 00:08:27,346
There 's another show tomorrow . Look at this .

32
00:08:27,472 --> 00:08:31,387
- I 'll be more careful . Sorry . - You 're always rushing off out of here .

33
00:08:31,513 --> 00:08:34,387
You 're all the same , that 's all you think about .

34
00:08:36,304 --> 00:08:37,970
What does she expect ? She 's so annoying .

35
00:08:38,096 --> 00:08:40,886
It 's not easy being a widow .

36
00:08:51,803 --> 00:08:53,219
Isabella !

37
00:09:18,592 --> 00:09:20,008
No , thanks .

38
00:09:22,217 --> 00:09:25,591
- How long were the lights off ? - Ten minutes .

39
00:09:27,050 --> 00:09:29,216
How long had the girl worked for you ?

40
00:09:30,050 --> 00:09:32,340
About two years .

41
00:09:33,383 --> 00:09:35,006
What was she like ?

42
00:09:36,924 --> 00:09:38,340
Very lively .

43
00:09:39,632 --> 00:09:42,923
A bit unruly , but there 's nothing bad I could say about her .

44
00:09:44,091 --> 00:09:46,673
As far as you know , did she have a lot of friends ?

45
00:09:47,507 --> 00:09:50,548
Inspector , I 'm not going to be much help here .

46
00:09:50,673 --> 00:09:52,505
I 'm the managing director .

47
00:09:52,631 --> 00:09:55,630
You should ask the two girls who lived with her .

48
00:10:10,630 --> 00:10:14,420
I can 't believe it . Such a terrible thing . I still can 't get my head round it .

49
00:10:14,547 --> 00:10:17,670
Poor thing , she was always so cheerful , so ...

50
00:10:17,796 --> 00:10:22,711
Come on , stop crying . It 's not going to do any good .

51
00:10:22,838 --> 00:10:27,086
Inspector Silverstri , this is Countess Cristiana , the owner of the company .

52
00:10:27,212 --> 00:10:29,044
- Good morning . - Good morning .

53
00:10:29,711 --> 00:10:32,752
Haven 't I met you before , madam ? Or am I mistaken ?

54
00:10:35,586 --> 00:10:38,127
Yes , we have actually met before .

55
00:10:38,253 --> 00:10:40,460
Because of my husband 's accident .

56
00:10:41,002 --> 00:10:44,292
Exactly . It was a car accident .

57
00:10:46,293 --> 00:10:50,167
I imagine you 'll be able to help me . You must know all about your girls .

58
00:10:51,043 --> 00:10:53,334
Inspector , this isn 't a boarding school .

59
00:10:53,459 --> 00:10:57,250
I don 't know or care about what they do when they 're not here .

60
00:10:59,042 --> 00:11:02,083
All right , I 'm going to be in the studio .

61
00:11:02,209 --> 00:11:04,541
- Will you excuse me ? - Of course .

62
00:11:16,541 --> 00:11:19,540
Come on , Peggy . Stop crying .

63
00:11:19,666 --> 00:11:21,998
What good is it going to do ?

64
00:11:22,124 --> 00:11:23,331
Come on .

65
00:11:28,249 --> 00:11:31,747
What time was it when you went out to fix the sign ?

66
00:11:31,873 --> 00:11:36,705
About seven . It was banging and the noise was irritating Madame Cristiana .

67
00:11:36,832 --> 00:11:40,704
I went out and fixed it as best I could .

68
00:11:40,831 --> 00:11:42,122
I protest !

69
00:11:42,248 --> 00:11:44,913
Mr Morlachi , I demand an explanation .

70
00:11:45,039 --> 00:11:48,788
I 'd only just come through the gates when these men grabbed me .

71
00:11:48,913 --> 00:11:50,579
- Ask the inspector . - Inspector ?

72
00:11:50,704 --> 00:11:53,037
Calm down and tell me why you 're here .

73
00:11:53,163 --> 00:11:57,703
- I 'm Marquis Riccardo Morelli ... - All right , but answer my question .

74
00:11:57,830 --> 00:12:00,245
He 's come to pick me up . He 's my fiancé .

75
00:12:01,287 --> 00:12:02,953
Fiancé !

76
00:12:03,079 --> 00:12:05,869
- Why are you laughing ? - Because we live together .

77
00:12:06,578 --> 00:12:08,161
Did you know Isabella ?

78
00:12:09,245 --> 00:12:10,577
Isabella ?

79
00:12:11,370 --> 00:12:14,035
You introduced us once , didn 't you ?

80
00:12:14,994 --> 00:12:18,035
Yes , I guess I knew her , but only by sight .

81
00:12:18,661 --> 00:12:19,827
I see .

82
00:12:21,911 --> 00:12:23,535
Come on , Peggy .

83
00:12:26,536 --> 00:12:27,951
Be strong .

84
00:12:29,452 --> 00:12:30,492
Stop crying .

85
00:12:30,618 --> 00:12:32,826
It looks like she 's the only one who 's upset .

86
00:12:32,952 --> 00:12:34,784
They were very good friends .

87
00:12:34,910 --> 00:12:37,367
- Did she live with you two ? - Yes .

88
00:12:37,493 --> 00:12:40,534
Who had she gone out with ? Who was the last person to see her ?

89
00:12:40,659 --> 00:12:42,283
I don 't know .

90
00:12:42,409 --> 00:12:46,033
Leave her alone . Everybody knows who Isabella 's lover was .

91
00:12:47,325 --> 00:12:50,699
- Who are you ? - Cesare Lazzarini , fashion designer .

92
00:12:50,825 --> 00:12:52,533
- Will you tell me his name ? - Whose ?

93
00:12:52,658 --> 00:12:53,949
The lover 's .

94
00:12:54,075 --> 00:12:57,198
Scalo . Franco Scalo , the famous antique dealer .

95
00:13:02,282 --> 00:13:04,989
- Police . Where 's the inspector ? - In there .

96
00:13:09,490 --> 00:13:12,155
I can assure you I don 't know anything .

97
00:13:13,573 --> 00:13:15,696
- Excuse me a second . - Sure .

98
00:13:18,656 --> 00:13:20,072
It 's confirmed .

99
00:13:21,280 --> 00:13:22,488
Shall I go ?

100
00:13:23,031 --> 00:13:25,238
- Yes , go . - All right .

101
00:13:34,196 --> 00:13:35,612
So ...

102
00:13:36,780 --> 00:13:40,653
Tell me , what kind of relationship did you have with Isabella ?

103
00:13:42,196 --> 00:13:44,820
- We were friends . - Or lovers ?

104
00:13:47,320 --> 00:13:50,569
I 'm going to admit to something , but you mustn 't be shocked .

105
00:13:50,695 --> 00:13:54,610
I don 't believe in permanent and everlasting relationships .

106
00:13:54,736 --> 00:13:55,819
I understand .

107
00:14:01,236 --> 00:14:03,026
Do you know what this is ?

108
00:14:05,444 --> 00:14:07,692
No , I don 't .

109
00:14:08,860 --> 00:14:11,567
- What is it ? - Cocaine .

110
00:14:12,984 --> 00:14:16,900
It was found in your friend Isabella 's house .

111
00:14:17,527 --> 00:14:19,150
In Isabella 's house ?

112
00:14:19,276 --> 00:14:22,733
- So you didn 't know about this ? - No .

113
00:14:23,400 --> 00:14:25,024
Never mind .

114
00:14:26,192 --> 00:14:30,316
But I must ask you to remain at my disposal .

115
00:14:30,983 --> 00:14:32,607
I 'll see you again .

116
00:14:41,607 --> 00:14:43,773
Autumn Evening .

117
00:14:46,941 --> 00:14:48,356
Turn around .

118
00:14:48,482 --> 00:14:51,397
All right , you can go . Quickly .

119
00:14:55,648 --> 00:14:59,563
- What 's wrong , Cesaretto ? - Isabella was supposed to model this .

120
00:14:59,689 --> 00:15:01,647
- You 're right . - Who should I give it to ?

121
00:15:01,773 --> 00:15:03,188
Let 's see ...

122
00:15:03,314 --> 00:15:06,313
- Peggy ... - Not me , please . I can 't .

123
00:15:06,439 --> 00:15:09,354
For heaven 's sake don 't cry or you 'll ruin your make-up .

124
00:15:09,480 --> 00:15:12,646
- Greta , you model it . - No , I 'm sorry , I can 't wear it .

125
00:15:12,772 --> 00:15:15,312
- Don 't be silly . - It 'll bring me bad luck .

126
00:15:15,438 --> 00:15:18,062
- Someone 's going to have to model it . - I will .

127
00:15:18,188 --> 00:15:19,395
Good . Come on , hurry up .

128
00:15:19,521 --> 00:15:22,728
Why doesn 't that surprise me ? She 's so cynical .

129
00:15:23,437 --> 00:15:25,478
All right , you can go .

130
00:16:02,184 --> 00:16:04,891
Turn round . Good . Walk .

131
00:16:10,558 --> 00:16:12,182
Hold on a second .

132
00:16:12,308 --> 00:16:13,933
Something 's missing .

133
00:16:14,767 --> 00:16:16,890
The brooch ! The green brooch .

134
00:16:17,016 --> 00:16:19,474
We can fix that now . Where is it ?

135
00:16:19,599 --> 00:16:25,348
Isabella brought her own . She kept it in one of these boxes .

136
00:16:32,349 --> 00:16:33,555
Here it is .

137
00:16:42,722 --> 00:16:45,429
Look what I 've found . Isabella kept a diary .

138
00:16:53,347 --> 00:16:54,970
It 'll be an interesting read .

139
00:16:55,097 --> 00:16:59,512
Listen . " He 's a man who arouses deep and desperate feelings in me .

140
00:16:59,638 --> 00:17:02,386
" I 'd be prepared to die for him . "

141
00:17:02,513 --> 00:17:03,720
Let me see .

142
00:17:04,679 --> 00:17:08,053
- I don 't think we 've got the right ... - What are you doing ? Are you all mad ?

143
00:17:08,720 --> 00:17:12,552
Does this seem like the right time ? Go on , off you go . Get ready .

144
00:17:16,886 --> 00:17:19,094
I think we should give this to the police .

145
00:17:19,220 --> 00:17:24,301
I found it and I 'd like to hand it in myself , if you don 't mind .

146
00:17:27,177 --> 00:17:28,801
As you wish .

147
00:17:56,175 --> 00:17:58,299
Ray of Moonlight .

148
00:18:55,337 --> 00:18:58,252
- Hello ? - Hello . Hello , Franco .

149
00:18:58,377 --> 00:18:59,794
Why didn 't you come ?

150
00:18:59,920 --> 00:19:03,001
I was on my way out but I 'm not feeling well . You know why .

151
00:19:03,127 --> 00:19:05,001
Sure , I understand .

152
00:19:05,127 --> 00:19:07,793
Try to come right away . I 've got some .

153
00:19:08,294 --> 00:19:11,334
Listen , Franco . I 've found a diary .

154
00:19:11,835 --> 00:19:13,918
- Isabella 's diary . - What ?

155
00:19:14,044 --> 00:19:16,626
Isabella 's diary ? Who else knows about it ?

156
00:19:17,460 --> 00:19:19,084
Everybody , unfortunately .

157
00:19:19,210 --> 00:19:23,500
I realised too late that there could be something compromising about you in it .

158
00:19:23,626 --> 00:19:26,917
I kept it and said I 'd hand it in to the police .

159
00:19:27,042 --> 00:19:29,750
Good . We 'll have time to take a look at it .

160
00:19:30,917 --> 00:19:34,874
- I 'll come straight over . - You don 't sound well at all , Franco .

161
00:19:35,374 --> 00:19:36,832
Franco !

162
00:19:36,958 --> 00:19:38,582
Franco , can you hear me ?

163
00:19:39,166 --> 00:19:40,791
Yes , Nicole .

164
00:19:40,916 --> 00:19:45,539
Sorry , I can 't even breathe . But now you 've got some I 'll feel better . Bye .

165
00:19:45,665 --> 00:19:47,290
I 'll see you soon .

166
00:19:50,916 --> 00:19:53,664
Hurry up , girls . Greta , you 're on next .

167
00:19:55,290 --> 00:19:57,997
- Everything all right there , Marco ? - Yes , Madame .

168
00:20:03,206 --> 00:20:05,205
- Cesaretto , where were you ? - I 'm here .

169
00:20:05,331 --> 00:20:08,913
I looked everywhere for you . Why do I have to do everything myself ?

170
00:20:14,330 --> 00:20:16,162
- Nicole ? - What is it ?

171
00:20:16,288 --> 00:20:17,329
Telephone call .

172
00:20:17,455 --> 00:20:19,287
- For me ? - Yes , for you .

173
00:20:24,579 --> 00:20:26,953
- Hello ? - Hello . Nicole , is that you ?

174
00:20:27,079 --> 00:20:29,827
- Yes . Who 's speaking ? - It 's Franco .

175
00:20:29,953 --> 00:20:33,119
I can 't make it over there . I feel too ill .

176
00:20:33,245 --> 00:20:36,161
You come over . Please . Now . I feel like I 'm suffocating .

177
00:20:36,286 --> 00:20:38,327
How am I supposed to get away ?

178
00:20:39,745 --> 00:20:42,118
All right , I 'll do my best .

179
00:20:42,703 --> 00:20:44,327
I 'll try to come right away .

180
00:20:48,161 --> 00:20:49,993
There , it 's all right now .

181
00:20:51,452 --> 00:20:53,785
Peggy , Franco 's sick . He needs me .

182
00:20:53,910 --> 00:20:56,992
I need to rush over and see him . Will you lend me your car ?

183
00:20:57,118 --> 00:20:59,117
But the show 's not over yet .

184
00:20:59,243 --> 00:21:02,617
I don 't care . Give me the keys but don 't let anyone see you .

185
00:21:02,743 --> 00:21:03,950
Hold on .

186
00:21:13,241 --> 00:21:17,948
- Peggy , what are you doing ? - Nothing , just getting my handkerchief .

187
00:21:23,532 --> 00:21:26,281
The alarm switch is hidden in the glove compartment .

188
00:21:26,407 --> 00:21:27,448
All right .

189
00:21:28,365 --> 00:21:29,782
Thank you .

190
00:21:54,697 --> 00:21:55,820
ANTIQUES

191
00:22:16,779 --> 00:22:18,167
Franco ?

192
00:28:13,499 --> 00:28:17,123
- Have fun but don 't come home too late . - Don 't worry .

193
00:28:24,498 --> 00:28:25,705
Marco !

194
00:28:27,248 --> 00:28:32,038
I want to keep you company till Tao-Li gets back .

195
00:28:32,913 --> 00:28:35,371
Aren 't you scared of being at home on your own ?

196
00:28:35,497 --> 00:28:39,537
I 'm actually very tired and I 'd like to go straight to bed .

197
00:28:39,663 --> 00:28:43,995
But you 'll have to stay up till Nicole brings your car back .

198
00:28:46,121 --> 00:28:47,662
Please .

199
00:28:47,787 --> 00:28:50,287
All right . As you wish . Come in .

200
00:28:50,413 --> 00:28:53,078
Thank you . I didn 't want to leave you .

201
00:28:53,204 --> 00:28:56,161
I 'd have worried about you being alone in that house .

202
00:29:18,618 --> 00:29:22,825
- Clarice , are you still here ? - Good evening , miss .

203
00:29:23,743 --> 00:29:25,783
Yes , I 've only just finished .

204
00:29:27,409 --> 00:29:30,034
Didn 't Miss Tao-Li come back with you ?

205
00:29:30,160 --> 00:29:32,283
She 's gone to a party . She 'll be home later .

206
00:29:32,409 --> 00:29:34,533
Clarice looks after us .

207
00:29:34,659 --> 00:29:39,241
I 'll be off , then . I left your dinner in the oven to keep it warm .

208
00:29:40,200 --> 00:29:44,198
If Miss Tao-Li wants her concoction , it 's ready . She just needs to heat it up .

209
00:29:44,324 --> 00:29:47,115
Thank you , Clarice . Good night . I 'll see you tomorrow .

210
00:29:47,241 --> 00:29:48,449
Good night .

211
00:29:56,866 --> 00:29:57,947
Peggy ...

212
00:29:59,073 --> 00:30:02,322
- You always refuse to listen to me . - I listen to you .

213
00:30:02,449 --> 00:30:06,739
You don 't . And I 'm tired of telling you the same thing over and over .

214
00:30:06,865 --> 00:30:09,280
I 've told you a thousand times .

215
00:30:10,989 --> 00:30:13,863
Sadly I 've fallen in love with you .

216
00:30:13,989 --> 00:30:16,696
But you don 't care . Why not ?

217
00:30:16,822 --> 00:30:19,404
Calm down and come here .

218
00:30:30,196 --> 00:30:31,403
You see ...

219
00:30:32,446 --> 00:30:34,069
I 'm not well .

220
00:30:34,945 --> 00:30:39,236
I know you think I 'm besotted , and that drives me insane .

221
00:30:41,029 --> 00:30:42,861
I 'm sick , unhappy ...

222
00:30:42,987 --> 00:30:46,985
Don 't be like that . I understand you . I 'm your friend . Come on , cheer up .

223
00:30:54,069 --> 00:30:58,109
- I 'll have one of your cigarettes . - No ! Stop ! Leave it .

224
00:30:58,235 --> 00:31:01,443
What is it ? I just wanted a cigarette . What have I done ?

225
00:31:03,735 --> 00:31:07,233
I 'll get it for you . You 'll mess up my bag otherwise .

226
00:31:09,401 --> 00:31:10,608
Here .

227
00:31:23,692 --> 00:31:24,732
Hello ?

228
00:31:24,858 --> 00:31:27,107
Good evening , it 's Inspector Silverstri .

229
00:31:27,233 --> 00:31:30,314
I 'm sorry to bother you . I 'm calling about your car .

230
00:31:30,441 --> 00:31:34,690
We found it unlocked and abandoned . Had it been stolen ?

231
00:31:35,232 --> 00:31:37,981
No , I lent it to my friend Nicole .

232
00:31:38,107 --> 00:31:39,314
Yes .

233
00:31:39,441 --> 00:31:43,605
Yes , she asked to borrow it so she could visit a friend who wasn 't well .

234
00:31:44,273 --> 00:31:45,814
Has something happened ?

235
00:31:45,940 --> 00:31:48,689
I 'd rather speak to you about this in person .

236
00:31:48,814 --> 00:31:50,730
I 'll come over to your house .

237
00:31:51,314 --> 00:31:53,147
All right , I 'll be here .

238
00:31:53,647 --> 00:31:54,688
What 's going on ?

239
00:31:54,814 --> 00:31:59,062
They 've found my car but not Nicole . Oh , God , what 's happened to her ?

240
00:31:59,188 --> 00:32:02,187
- Is the inspector coming ? - Yes , he wants to speak to me .

241
00:32:03,105 --> 00:32:07,854
I 'll be off , then . I 'd rather the police didn 't find me with you .

242
00:32:07,980 --> 00:32:11,020
Yes , it 's best if nobody knows you came here .

243
00:32:11,604 --> 00:32:15,478
Yes , it is best . Especially for you .

244
00:32:15,603 --> 00:32:18,228
- I 'm sorry . - I 'll see you tomorrow .

245
00:32:18,353 --> 00:32:19,561
See you tomorrow .

246
00:33:00,350 --> 00:33:03,974
" I caught Peggy trying to steal 100,000 lire from my bag .

247
00:33:04,100 --> 00:33:06,640
" She started crying and told me she needed it .

248
00:33:06,766 --> 00:33:09,223
" She 's pregnant but can 't deal with the scandal .

249
00:33:09,349 --> 00:33:11,973
" I lent her the money because I felt sorry for her .

250
00:33:12,099 --> 00:33:15,889
" Tomorrow I 'll ask the bastard for 200,000 lire . "

251
00:35:09,631 --> 00:35:12,839
WHERE IS THE DIARY ?

252
00:35:19,172 --> 00:35:21,171
I burnt it ... I burnt it ...

253
00:35:21,630 --> 00:35:22,671
I burnt it !

254
00:37:09,579 --> 00:37:10,996
Miss Peggy ?

255
00:38:34,198 --> 00:38:35,613
Good evening .

256
00:38:35,739 --> 00:38:40,238
Sorry , I know it 's late for visiting , but this is an urgent matter .

257
00:38:40,364 --> 00:38:42,737
Don 't worry . Please , have a seat .

258
00:38:42,863 --> 00:38:44,696
What 's it about ?

259
00:38:46,530 --> 00:38:48,779
Charles , you can go .

260
00:38:59,988 --> 00:39:04,569
I got back a short while ago and found Nicole in my shop ...

261
00:39:04,696 --> 00:39:05,777
murdered .

262
00:39:06,362 --> 00:39:07,610
My God !

263
00:39:09,987 --> 00:39:12,610
I 'd gone to the studio to pick Nicole up .

264
00:39:14,277 --> 00:39:17,276
Remember ? We bumped into each other .

265
00:39:17,944 --> 00:39:21,484
I looked everywhere but I couldn 't find her .

266
00:39:21,610 --> 00:39:23,442
So I went back home .

267
00:39:24,360 --> 00:39:27,651
Believe me , I 'll never forget what I saw .

268
00:39:27,777 --> 00:39:32,317
Sorry , but why did you come here instead of going to the police ?

269
00:39:34,401 --> 00:39:36,233
Nicole was my friend .

270
00:39:37,026 --> 00:39:38,858
She was killed in my shop .

271
00:39:39,651 --> 00:39:41,899
The police are bound to blame me .

272
00:39:42,025 --> 00:39:43,649
I need an alibi .

273
00:39:44,483 --> 00:39:48,691
- You 've got to help me . - Me ? What have I got to do with this ?

274
00:39:49,608 --> 00:39:52,732
You 're in as much trouble as I am .

275
00:39:54,316 --> 00:39:58,273
We need to say that we were together at the studio until we left .

276
00:39:59,066 --> 00:40:01,856
I 'll vouch for you and you 'll vouch for me .

277
00:40:03,107 --> 00:40:05,855
- It 's in both of our interests . - You 're insane .

278
00:40:05,982 --> 00:40:08,480
The police have no reason to suspect me .

279
00:40:09,107 --> 00:40:12,772
You 're the one who 's in a fix . Maybe you really did kill her .

280
00:40:13,231 --> 00:40:17,021
No . Call the police right now or I 'll do it .

281
00:40:17,981 --> 00:40:21,105
Go on , then , and you can tell them about the lOUs .

282
00:40:21,231 --> 00:40:22,437
What lOUs ?

283
00:40:23,522 --> 00:40:27,145
The IOUs you signed to guarantee a seven million lire loan for Isabella

284
00:40:27,271 --> 00:40:29,104
that you couldn 't pay .

285
00:40:30,021 --> 00:40:33,436
Is that true ? Riccardo , you didn 't tell me . Is it true ?

286
00:40:34,521 --> 00:40:36,478
Oh , my God .

287
00:40:36,604 --> 00:40:39,603
My dear Marquis , you haven 't got a penny to your name .

288
00:40:39,729 --> 00:40:43,061
You 're completely ruined and afraid of the scandal .

289
00:40:44,020 --> 00:40:47,310
That 's a pretty good reason to kill Isabella

290
00:40:47,895 --> 00:40:52,810
and maybe Nicole too , to make sure the police didn 't get hold of the diary .

291
00:40:52,936 --> 00:40:58,143
Who knows , maybe all the expiry dates were written in it .

292
00:40:58,269 --> 00:41:00,226
What diary ? I don 't know anything about it .

293
00:41:00,352 --> 00:41:04,476
Don 't lie , Riccardo . I told you Nicole had found Isabella 's diary .

294
00:41:04,602 --> 00:41:08,393
As you can see , we 're tied to each other by a strong thread .

295
00:41:09,518 --> 00:41:13,809
If you don 't want the police sticking their noses into your business ,

296
00:41:13,935 --> 00:41:16,433
you 'd better do as I say .

297
00:41:16,559 --> 00:41:20,141
I 'll go back to my shop now and call the inspector .

298
00:41:20,267 --> 00:41:24,432
I 'll tell him that we were together all the time . All right ?

299
00:41:25,684 --> 00:41:27,099
Good night .

300
00:42:22,804 --> 00:42:26,427
Why won 't you believe me ? I burnt that diary .

301
00:42:26,553 --> 00:42:31,260
It contained things about me that I didn 't want people to know .

302
00:42:39,052 --> 00:42:42,717
I burnt it . I swear I burnt it .

303
00:42:42,843 --> 00:42:44,842
Believe me . Believe me !

304
00:43:02,717 --> 00:43:03,758
No !

305
00:43:31,507 --> 00:43:33,922
How did that girl get in here ?

306
00:43:35,340 --> 00:43:37,672
- She had a key . - How come ?

307
00:43:38,589 --> 00:43:40,213
I 'd given it to her .

308
00:43:40,964 --> 00:43:43,712
- She used to visit me sometimes . - Her as well ?

309
00:43:44,797 --> 00:43:46,421
You mustn 't think that I ...

310
00:43:47,713 --> 00:43:49,796
I 'd left Isabella for Nicole .

311
00:43:49,922 --> 00:43:52,545
How many other people had keys to that door ?

312
00:43:52,672 --> 00:43:54,128
Nobody else .

313
00:43:54,672 --> 00:43:57,836
- Except me , of course . - Of course .

314
00:44:04,962 --> 00:44:07,002
Did you take drugs with her too ?

315
00:44:08,628 --> 00:44:12,169
- What are you saying , Inspector ? - Come on , Scalo !

316
00:44:12,295 --> 00:44:14,293
Who are you trying to kid ?

317
00:44:15,711 --> 00:44:19,960
You 've got a drug habit . It 's written all over your face .

318
00:44:20,086 --> 00:44:23,085
I can even tell you where you get your drugs .

319
00:44:23,710 --> 00:44:24,918
And ...

320
00:44:25,710 --> 00:44:30,501
as for the girls who , shall we say , keep you company ,

321
00:44:30,627 --> 00:44:33,750
or who try to fight your habit , like Isabella did ,

322
00:44:33,876 --> 00:44:37,000
or who take drugs themselves , like this one ...

323
00:44:37,960 --> 00:44:39,208
That may well be the case ,

324
00:44:39,334 --> 00:44:42,999
but it doesn 't mean that I 'm a murderer .

325
00:44:44,167 --> 00:44:46,916
Besides , I have an alibi . I was with ...

326
00:44:47,042 --> 00:44:49,916
I haven 't asked you about that ... yet .

327
00:44:51,084 --> 00:44:52,916
We 'll talk about it in good time .

328
00:44:53,958 --> 00:44:57,665
- When ? - Right now , in my office .

329
00:45:38,371 --> 00:45:40,912
- Do you recognise it ? - Yes , that 's the one .

330
00:45:41,037 --> 00:45:42,869
- Are you sure ? - Yes .

331
00:45:42,995 --> 00:45:45,911
Hold on . I wrote down the first few numbers .

332
00:45:46,037 --> 00:45:49,203
Here we go ... 4 , 5 , 3 . What did I tell you ?

333
00:45:49,328 --> 00:45:53,077
Did you see if a man or a woman was driving ?

334
00:45:53,203 --> 00:45:54,619
A man , definitely .

335
00:45:54,745 --> 00:45:58,369
He was all in black and he didn 't seem to have a face .

336
00:45:58,495 --> 00:46:00,868
Maybe he was wearing a mask .

337
00:46:01,494 --> 00:46:04,701
Maybe , I don 't know . I looked at him because I heard a horn .

338
00:46:04,827 --> 00:46:07,992
- What horn ? - The car horn , Inspector .

339
00:46:08,118 --> 00:46:10,575
It beeped , but not for very long .

340
00:46:10,701 --> 00:46:13,076
Then suddenly it stopped .

341
00:46:16,117 --> 00:46:18,991
Could there be an alarm connected to the horn , Zanchin ?

342
00:46:19,117 --> 00:46:20,950
Hold on , I 'll check .

343
00:46:27,992 --> 00:46:31,282
Yes , there is one . It 's at the back of the glove compartment .

344
00:46:31,408 --> 00:46:33,907
- How long did it beep for ? - I don 't know .

345
00:46:34,033 --> 00:46:37,324
- Not very long , like I said . - Tell me how long .

346
00:46:38,950 --> 00:46:40,949
That 's it . Pretty much that long .

347
00:46:41,699 --> 00:46:45,198
If you didn 't know where it was , you 'd take a while to find it .

348
00:46:45,324 --> 00:46:46,572
Right .

349
00:46:46,698 --> 00:46:48,822
But if you did know where it was hidden ,

350
00:46:49,740 --> 00:46:51,948
you 'd only need a few seconds .

351
00:47:22,404 --> 00:47:24,362
Come through .

352
00:47:26,112 --> 00:47:27,736
After you .

353
00:47:35,653 --> 00:47:37,401
Have a good look at these men .

354
00:47:37,527 --> 00:47:40,401
Did you ever see any of them in Miss Peggy 's car ?

355
00:47:40,527 --> 00:47:43,068
- Hello , Mr Morlachi . - Hello , Clarice .

356
00:47:43,194 --> 00:47:44,859
You know him ? You 've seen him in the car ?

357
00:47:44,985 --> 00:47:46,776
Of course she 's seen me .

358
00:47:46,902 --> 00:47:51,026
In the car and walking , lots of times . All perfectly normal .

359
00:47:51,152 --> 00:47:52,984
I didn 't say it wasn 't .

360
00:47:54,443 --> 00:47:55,651
Let 's keep going .

361
00:47:56,193 --> 00:47:59,608
- Him . I saw him in the car . - Of course . Big deal .

362
00:47:59,734 --> 00:48:02,858
What 's the point of this ? It 's all a farce .

363
00:48:02,984 --> 00:48:04,608
Be quiet .

364
00:48:05,359 --> 00:48:07,566
You didn 't just see me , did you ?

365
00:48:07,692 --> 00:48:09,441
Open your eyes , you idiot .

366
00:48:09,567 --> 00:48:12,358
Him , for instance . You saw him too , didn 't you ?

367
00:48:13,524 --> 00:48:16,357
Do you only want to know who went in the car with Miss Peggy ?

368
00:48:16,483 --> 00:48:17,523
Why ?

369
00:48:18,900 --> 00:48:22,607
Because that gentleman came to the house last night .

370
00:48:22,732 --> 00:48:24,606
He came with Miss Peggy .

371
00:48:24,732 --> 00:48:27,648
At last we 're getting somewhere .

372
00:48:27,774 --> 00:48:32,522
You bastard ! What are you trying to insinuate ? Do you want to ruin me ?

373
00:48:32,649 --> 00:48:34,230
That 's enough .

374
00:48:34,357 --> 00:48:36,439
Bloody murderer !

375
00:48:36,564 --> 00:48:40,396
Damn you ! Own up to it . You 're the murderer .

376
00:48:40,522 --> 00:48:44,063
Inspector , have him examined . He 's impotent .

377
00:48:44,189 --> 00:48:48,562
That 's why he hates women . He 'd kill them all because he can 't have them .

378
00:48:49,605 --> 00:48:53,604
Why don 't you tell the inspector that that 's why your wife left you ?

379
00:48:54,688 --> 00:48:57,895
Oh , my God . Oh , my God , I 'm suffocating .

380
00:48:59,854 --> 00:49:01,978
- Hold his shoulders . - Calm down .

381
00:49:03,938 --> 00:49:05,770
Take him to the infirmary .

382
00:49:07,062 --> 00:49:09,645
No ! Let me go !

383
00:49:10,187 --> 00:49:12,019
Let me go !

384
00:49:15,770 --> 00:49:19,185
- None of you knew he had epilepsy ? - I didn 't know .

385
00:49:21,645 --> 00:49:23,060
You can go .

386
00:49:26,144 --> 00:49:27,976
Goodbye , Clarice .

387
00:49:30,393 --> 00:49:35,059
I 'm very sorry but I 'm going to have to keep you here , Mr Morlachi ,

388
00:49:35,185 --> 00:49:37,017
and you too , Mr Lazzarini .

389
00:49:37,143 --> 00:49:42,059
- What does " keep you here " mean ? - It means I 'm legally detaining you .

390
00:49:42,184 --> 00:49:45,974
Excuse me , Inspector , but you need a good reason to do that .

391
00:49:50,683 --> 00:49:54,349
Nicole 's murderer had been in Peggy 's car before

392
00:49:54,475 --> 00:49:57,432
because he knew where the alarm switch was hidden .

393
00:49:59,058 --> 00:50:00,307
- Can I go ? - Can I ?

394
00:50:00,849 --> 00:50:03,473
No , you 'll stay here too .

395
00:50:04,183 --> 00:50:07,723
This is absurd . I 've provided an alibi .

396
00:50:07,849 --> 00:50:11,264
- The Marquis confirmed it . - It 's true . We were together .

397
00:50:11,390 --> 00:50:15,347
Don 't worry , gentlemen , I haven 't forgotten .

398
00:50:15,473 --> 00:50:19,971
You were together until gone 11 . Nicole was killed after 10 .

399
00:50:20,097 --> 00:50:22,721
- So why do you need us ? - Well ...

400
00:50:23,389 --> 00:50:27,638
When I called Peggy to tell her that we 'd found her car ,

401
00:50:27,764 --> 00:50:29,596
it was about half past 11 .

402
00:50:29,722 --> 00:50:32,304
I got to her place a quarter of an hour later ,

403
00:50:32,430 --> 00:50:35,929
but she was no longer there and the house was in a complete mess .

404
00:50:36,055 --> 00:50:40,095
Maybe they killed her too and hid her body somewhere .

405
00:50:40,930 --> 00:50:43,553
As far as this last event is concerned , gentlemen ,

406
00:50:43,679 --> 00:50:46,386
I 'd say your alibi was pretty useless .

407
00:51:03,969 --> 00:51:05,801
It 's already nine o 'clock .

408
00:51:22,051 --> 00:51:26,216
Why do we have to sit in the dark ? As if we weren 't scared enough already .

409
00:51:28,217 --> 00:51:30,549
Do what you want , but try to stay calm .

410
00:51:30,675 --> 00:51:32,965
How can we stay calm ?

411
00:51:33,091 --> 00:51:35,549
Aren 't you worried about everything that 's happened ?

412
00:51:35,675 --> 00:51:39,090
I 'm scared too , I admit it .

413
00:51:40,216 --> 00:51:42,214
But there 's no point in panicking .

414
00:51:43,424 --> 00:51:45,715
I wish some of the men would come back .

415
00:51:45,841 --> 00:51:48,465
We 're the only ones left at the studio .

416
00:51:54,798 --> 00:51:56,130
Hello ?

417
00:51:57,048 --> 00:52:00,088
Mr Morlachi , at last . What 's happened ?

418
00:52:03,839 --> 00:52:05,047
What ?

419
00:52:09,880 --> 00:52:14,338
That 's ridiculous . Why ? What right do they have ?

420
00:52:21,046 --> 00:52:22,670
Oh , yes .

421
00:52:24,379 --> 00:52:25,794
I see .

422
00:52:27,921 --> 00:52:29,128
All right .

423
00:52:30,462 --> 00:52:32,044
Of course .

424
00:52:32,170 --> 00:52:34,002
Yes , don 't worry .

425
00:52:35,128 --> 00:52:36,336
All right .

426
00:52:44,961 --> 00:52:47,959
- They 've detained all five of them . - Why ?

427
00:52:49,835 --> 00:52:54,459
Clearly the police believe that one of them is the murderer .

428
00:52:54,585 --> 00:52:56,417
I knew it .

429
00:52:58,001 --> 00:52:59,417
Madame ...

430
00:53:00,043 --> 00:53:01,666
can we go ?

431
00:53:02,792 --> 00:53:04,750
Yes , please go .

432
00:53:04,876 --> 00:53:06,708
Be strong .

433
00:53:08,043 --> 00:53:09,666
- Good night . - Good night .

434
00:53:12,626 --> 00:53:15,416
I really envy those three living together .

435
00:53:15,541 --> 00:53:17,665
At least they can keep each other company .

436
00:53:17,791 --> 00:53:21,332
- I 'm going too , Madame . - Yes , of course .

437
00:53:25,166 --> 00:53:29,456
Wait ... Why don 't you come and sleep at my house tonight ?

438
00:53:29,582 --> 00:53:31,581
What ? I just live round the corner .

439
00:53:31,707 --> 00:53:34,456
Why should I go all the way to yours out in the country ?

440
00:53:34,582 --> 00:53:37,122
I could come and sleep at your house , then .

441
00:53:37,248 --> 00:53:40,372
No , I 'm sorry , but I 'd rather be on my own .

442
00:53:40,497 --> 00:53:43,622
And I think you 'd feel even more afraid at my house .

443
00:53:43,748 --> 00:53:46,913
Aren 't you scared on your own ? They lived with you .

444
00:53:47,039 --> 00:53:49,538
Isabella 's been killed , and Peggy ...

445
00:53:50,622 --> 00:53:52,038
Yes , I know .

446
00:53:53,247 --> 00:53:56,287
But I 'm certain that nothing will happen tonight .

447
00:53:56,788 --> 00:53:59,078
All the men have been detained

448
00:53:59,538 --> 00:54:02,412
and I 'm sure one of them is the murderer .

449
00:54:06,621 --> 00:54:08,620
- Good night , Madame . - Good night .

450
00:54:09,329 --> 00:54:13,161
Madame , I don 't want to go home , I want to sleep here .

451
00:54:13,287 --> 00:54:16,369
No , my dear . You need to go like the others . Good night .

452
00:54:16,494 --> 00:54:20,327
But I 'm frightened . I live out of town in a house on its own .

453
00:54:20,453 --> 00:54:24,201
Don 't be a baby , Greta . We 've got a big day tomorrow .

454
00:54:24,328 --> 00:54:26,160
Work must go on .

455
00:54:26,286 --> 00:54:27,327
Listen ...

456
00:54:28,036 --> 00:54:31,284
Isabella and Nicole were mixed up in a nasty business

457
00:54:31,410 --> 00:54:33,242
that doesn 't concern us .

458
00:54:33,368 --> 00:54:36,492
We 've got nothing to be frightened of . Do you understand ?

459
00:54:37,076 --> 00:54:39,950
Off you go . Don 't worry .

460
00:54:40,076 --> 00:54:42,450
- Good night , Madame . - Good night .

461
00:55:12,365 --> 00:55:13,822
Good night .

462
00:57:25,438 --> 00:57:26,895
Miss ...

463
00:57:30,812 --> 00:57:34,269
Miss , the Marquis called to say

464
00:57:34,395 --> 00:57:36,477
that something came up and he 's stuck in town .

465
00:57:36,604 --> 00:57:38,977
I know . Can you make me some tea , please ?

466
00:57:39,103 --> 00:57:40,519
Right away , miss .

467
00:58:36,724 --> 00:58:38,514
Hello ? Hello ?

468
00:59:54,550 --> 00:59:57,008
I 've brought your tea , miss .

469
00:59:57,134 --> 00:59:59,132
Just a moment , please .

470
01:00:27,172 --> 01:00:28,380
Come in .

471
01:00:49,045 --> 01:00:52,461
Leave it up there , Charles . I can do it myself .

472
01:00:53,045 --> 01:00:54,878
Good night , miss .

473
01:04:07,238 --> 01:04:09,945
Did you see how the murderer attacked that poor girl ?

474
01:04:10,071 --> 01:04:13,611
He must have used a red-hot iron . We 're dealing with a madman here .

475
01:04:13,737 --> 01:04:16,278
Or a homicidal sex maniac .

476
01:04:16,404 --> 01:04:19,319
- Who only kills beautiful girls . - Exactly .

477
01:04:20,320 --> 01:04:24,360
Perhaps female beauty makes him lose his head and kill .

478
01:04:25,528 --> 01:04:28,318
We 're going to have to start again from scratch .

479
01:04:28,444 --> 01:04:32,568
Inspector , Forensics are outside if you want to see the footprints in the garden .

480
01:04:44,485 --> 01:04:46,608
The footprints start over there .

481
01:04:46,734 --> 01:04:48,942
The murderer drove up here on this road ,

482
01:04:49,068 --> 01:04:52,024
got out and walked down the slope to the house .

483
01:04:52,400 --> 01:04:55,525
The prints match the ones found in the studio gardens .

484
01:04:55,651 --> 01:04:59,233
- Are you sure ? - Yes , we took casts of them .

485
01:05:09,566 --> 01:05:14,148
I could have sworn the culprit was one of the five men we detained .

486
01:05:14,274 --> 01:05:17,272
- We 'll have to release them at once . - Of course .

487
01:05:17,899 --> 01:05:21,439
This time they really do have a cast-iron alibi .

488
01:05:22,457 --> 01:05:24,830
And I provided them with it .

489
01:05:24,957 --> 01:05:27,914
Riccardo Morelli . Make sure everything 's there .

490
01:05:34,789 --> 01:05:36,788
Massimo Morlachi .

491
01:07:01,365 --> 01:07:02,572
Come in .

492
01:07:04,698 --> 01:07:08,113
Mr Morlachi , I 'd like to speak to you for a moment if I may .

493
01:07:08,239 --> 01:07:09,863
Yes , dear . Come in .

494
01:07:16,238 --> 01:07:20,154
Mr Morlachi , I 'm a calm woman , I 'm not at all nervous .

495
01:07:20,280 --> 01:07:24,279
But I find the thought of a sex maniac prowling around our studio

496
01:07:24,780 --> 01:07:27,112
really very disturbing .

497
01:07:27,237 --> 01:07:29,986
I 've decided to take some holiday .

498
01:07:30,446 --> 01:07:33,736
I 've booked a seat on the flight to Paris tomorrow .

499
01:07:33,862 --> 01:07:34,903
Paris ?

500
01:07:35,862 --> 01:07:37,569
- All right , Tao-Li . - Thank you .

501
01:07:37,695 --> 01:07:41,444
By the way , are you still living in the countess 's house ?

502
01:07:41,570 --> 01:07:45,110
- Yes . Why ? - Nothing . Just memories .

503
01:07:45,236 --> 01:07:49,194
When the count was alive I 'd often go and visit them .

504
01:07:49,320 --> 01:07:50,526
It 's a beautiful house .

505
01:07:50,653 --> 01:07:54,026
I remember being able to see all over Rome from the terrace .

506
01:07:54,152 --> 01:07:57,276
Yes , but right now I 'd rather see the rooftops of Paris .

507
01:07:57,402 --> 01:08:00,692
- I don 't doubt that . Have fun . - Goodbye .

508
01:09:42,310 --> 01:09:46,100
Search as much as you like . I burnt everything that could compromise you .

509
01:09:46,226 --> 01:09:49,558
When I heard you 'd been arrested

510
01:09:49,684 --> 01:09:51,850
I got rid of Peggy 's body .

511
01:09:53,026 --> 01:09:54,275
They could have found it .

512
01:09:54,400 --> 01:09:57,816
And I killed Greta to give you an alibi .

513
01:09:57,943 --> 01:09:59,066
Perfect .

514
01:09:59,825 --> 01:10:01,657
Perfect but horrible .

515
01:10:03,075 --> 01:10:05,199
I don 't know how I did it .

516
01:10:05,658 --> 01:10:08,866
I 'd never have thought I 'd have the strength to kill .

517
01:10:11,033 --> 01:10:12,865
But I did it for you .

518
01:10:13,741 --> 01:10:16,573
I can imagine what it cost you .

519
01:10:16,699 --> 01:10:22,281
But tell me , how did you manage to take Peggy 's body to Morelli 's house ?

520
01:10:23,365 --> 01:10:25,364
I didn 't take her there myself .

521
01:10:26,073 --> 01:10:29,488
I just put her in the boot ...

522
01:10:30,406 --> 01:10:31,822
and Greta did the rest .

523
01:10:31,948 --> 01:10:34,280
Why did you decide to use Greta ?

524
01:10:34,406 --> 01:10:38,738
Well , I knew she 'd be on her own at home .

525
01:10:39,058 --> 01:10:42,598
- That made everything easier . - Well done .

526
01:10:42,623 --> 01:10:47,288
The police are convinced they 're dealing with a sex maniac .

527
01:10:47,988 --> 01:10:51,195
Isabella , Nicole ...

528
01:10:51,972 --> 01:10:53,387
Peggy ...

529
01:10:54,904 --> 01:10:59,486
and now , with Greta , that makes four .

530
01:11:01,112 --> 01:11:02,319
Stop it .

531
01:11:06,403 --> 01:11:09,318
Sweetheart , what 's wrong ?

532
01:11:10,653 --> 01:11:12,068
Kiss me .

533
01:11:23,527 --> 01:11:26,026
Are you worried , darling ?

534
01:11:26,152 --> 01:11:27,567
What a mess .

535
01:11:28,401 --> 01:11:32,900
It 's all because of that stupid idiot Isabella .

536
01:11:33,609 --> 01:11:35,899
Her blackmail had become unbearable .

537
01:11:36,026 --> 01:11:39,066
Money , money and more money .

538
01:11:39,192 --> 01:11:42,482
Precisely because she unfortunately found out ...

539
01:11:43,734 --> 01:11:47,441
that my husband 's death wasn 't an accident ,

540
01:11:48,150 --> 01:11:52,190
she should have realised that it was both foolish and dangerous to push it .

541
01:11:52,316 --> 01:11:54,024
But no ... No ...

542
01:11:54,983 --> 01:11:58,231
The more we gave her , the more she wanted .

543
01:12:01,024 --> 01:12:04,564
- She asked for it . - She thought she had us on a string .

544
01:12:05,315 --> 01:12:08,355
She felt like she was the only witness to a perfect crime .

545
01:12:09,273 --> 01:12:13,605
Her death would have been perfect too ,

546
01:12:14,440 --> 01:12:18,063
if only that bloody diary hadn 't cropped up .

547
01:12:21,814 --> 01:12:24,688
But it 's all over now .

548
01:12:24,813 --> 01:12:29,104
We 've got nothing to worry about now , darling . Nothing at all .

549
01:12:29,230 --> 01:12:31,603
No , that 's where you 're wrong . Very wrong .

550
01:12:32,396 --> 01:12:34,520
The two of us will never have any peace

551
01:12:35,354 --> 01:12:38,186
until we give the police a culprit .

552
01:12:38,312 --> 01:12:39,936
Peace !

553
01:12:42,187 --> 01:12:43,477
Listen to me .

554
01:12:43,603 --> 01:12:45,977
We 'll never get away with it

555
01:12:46,103 --> 01:12:48,977
unless we put a face to their sex maniac .

556
01:12:49,562 --> 01:12:52,560
Until they catch him they 'll be watching us .

557
01:12:52,686 --> 01:12:55,643
All the girls who were killed worked at the studio .

558
01:12:55,769 --> 01:13:00,393
They 've got no proof against us but the case has become a sensation .

559
01:13:00,519 --> 01:13:03,518
It 's all over the papers . The scandal 's raging .

560
01:13:05,019 --> 01:13:06,851
We need to find a solution .

561
01:13:09,810 --> 01:13:11,642
So what do you want to do ?

562
01:13:13,601 --> 01:13:17,766
I know , darling . We should go away to the moon .

563
01:13:21,934 --> 01:13:24,391
We need to kill one last time .

564
01:13:25,142 --> 01:13:26,974
And you 'll be the one who does it .

565
01:13:30,975 --> 01:13:32,598
- No . - Yes .

566
01:13:32,725 --> 01:13:34,557
They 're definitely watching me .

567
01:13:34,683 --> 01:13:38,140
Don 't worry , darling , I 'll create a perfect alibi for you .

568
01:13:38,266 --> 01:13:39,597
Stay calm .

569
01:13:40,224 --> 01:13:43,806
No , Massimo . You can 't ask me to do a thing like that .

570
01:13:43,932 --> 01:13:46,222
I refuse . I can 't do it . Do you understand ?

571
01:13:46,348 --> 01:13:47,972
You 've done it already .

572
01:13:49,098 --> 01:13:51,139
Yes , you 're right , I 've done it already ,

573
01:13:51,265 --> 01:13:53,722
but I had a very different motive then .

574
01:13:53,848 --> 01:13:56,014
You were in danger . I had no choice .

575
01:13:56,639 --> 01:13:59,638
I knew that if I didn 't do it

576
01:13:59,764 --> 01:14:01,971
I 'd have lost you forever .

577
01:14:03,264 --> 01:14:06,345
My love for you gave me the strength to do it .

578
01:14:08,180 --> 01:14:10,595
But it was horrible .

579
01:14:11,555 --> 01:14:12,762
Horrible !

580
01:14:14,054 --> 01:14:16,053
Don 't cry . Listen to me .

581
01:14:18,429 --> 01:14:21,219
You need to do what I say . You have to kill Tao-Li .

582
01:14:22,721 --> 01:14:26,969
You have to make it look like suicide . Do you understand ?

583
01:14:28,470 --> 01:14:30,302
They 'Il find the mask by her side

584
01:14:30,428 --> 01:14:33,719
and think that she was the culprit .

585
01:14:34,219 --> 01:14:38,135
If we don 't do it , everything we 've done so far will have been pointless .

586
01:23:27,467 --> 01:23:32,757
You 're surprised to see me alive , aren 't you , Massimo ?

587
01:23:33,716 --> 01:23:37,799
Your plan was certainly very ingenious .

588
01:23:38,633 --> 01:23:42,756
It was going to be perfect , just the way you like it ,

589
01:23:43,383 --> 01:23:46,090
but you didn 't reckon

590
01:23:46,216 --> 01:23:48,381
on the shop awning

591
01:23:50,007 --> 01:23:52,297
breaking my fall .

592
01:23:52,923 --> 01:23:53,964
Please ...

593
01:23:54,798 --> 01:23:56,214
Be quiet .

594
01:23:57,839 --> 01:24:01,672
I know very well what you 'd like to say . You 'd like to deny it .

595
01:24:01,798 --> 01:24:04,463
But I saw you with the jewels . You planned everything .

596
01:24:04,589 --> 01:24:08,796
Only you knew that I 'd use the ledge if I was in danger .

597
01:24:08,922 --> 01:24:13,129
Remember ? You were the one who suggested it . It was your idea .

598
01:24:15,922 --> 01:24:18,504
Cristiana , I swear it was an accident .

599
01:24:18,630 --> 01:24:22,045
Do you really still think that you can fool me ?

600
01:24:22,171 --> 01:24:23,795
Yes ...

601
01:24:23,921 --> 01:24:26,878
Yes , it was a very ingenious plan .

602
01:24:27,004 --> 01:24:29,002
They 'd have found me dressed like this

603
01:24:29,128 --> 01:24:32,086
and everything would have been clear

604
01:24:32,212 --> 01:24:34,044
and you 'd have been free .

605
01:24:35,212 --> 01:24:39,335
Now I understand why you wanted to marry me in secret

606
01:24:39,795 --> 01:24:41,418
and in such a hurry .

607
01:24:41,544 --> 01:24:45,751
You were so in love with me . So in love .

608
01:24:45,877 --> 01:24:49,542
You were , but with my villa , the house ,

609
01:24:50,002 --> 01:24:52,125
the studio , my money ...

610
01:24:52,251 --> 01:24:56,125
You wanted to get your hands on everything I own by killing me .

611
01:25:02,334 --> 01:25:03,833
Cristiana , I beg you ...

612
01:25:04,834 --> 01:25:07,874
You 're wrong , darling . It 's not true .

613
01:25:10,167 --> 01:25:11,582
It 's not true .

614
01:25:13,750 --> 01:25:17,582
You 're imagining it all , darling . Believe me .

615
01:25:19,166 --> 01:25:21,082
I swear , Cristiana ...

616
01:25:22,208 --> 01:25:26,082
It was just an accident . I didn 't mean it to happen .

617
01:25:26,207 --> 01:25:27,915
How could you think that ?

618
01:25:28,582 --> 01:25:30,872
I love you , darling , so much .

619
01:25:30,998 --> 01:25:34,497
We 'll go away . We 'll be together forever .

620
01:25:38,040 --> 01:25:40,080
I 'll never leave you .

621
01:26:52,700 --> 01:26:54,157
Police ...

622
01:26:55,325 --> 01:26:56,907
Get me ...

623
01:26:57,783 --> 01:27:01,282
Get me Inspector Silverstri ...

